","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZUx3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fca00b29-60fc-4231-88da-8abde0102f2b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"お","ts":"1621499216.226500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hmsGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4a5c087-53fd-4b7c-a1c0-9ec4d32b5c62","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"欲しいのは手動補完ですよね？\n```  inoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;c-space\u0026gt; coc#refresh()```\nこれで \u0026lt;C-Space\u0026gt; で補完できるようですが違いそうですかね。","ts":"1621499191.226300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"by2i5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d95a8bb7-8ec9-4728-af8e-a0d8ae76a057","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、coc-omni動かんな…","ts":"1621498919.225600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j9yil"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ae8fb92-9ba9-4c83-a4a8-a16251794dce","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あとは、omniを設定すれば良さそう","ts":"1621498447.225300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YmuM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d933036-3905-4b4c-972e-6dc7eaed9aef","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"↑の設定でメッセージがでなくなりました","ts":"1621498436.225000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oMzZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"daa11281-bf11-4a80-9a41-b85326668d12","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"再起動していないだけだった…ｗ","ts":"1621498383.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fn1yo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e26e92d1-95c4-4aaf-b766-b520bdaa08fe","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これをやっても、メッセージ出るなぁ…\n```  \"suggest.keepCompleteopt\": true,\n  \"suggest.autoTrigger\": \"none\"```","ts":"1621498225.224500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rgT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"370f10eb-4754-45ba-8be4-1bda30450b3c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ちょっと試してみます","ts":"1621498122.224000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lBNuh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc4fd997-9165-475e-9395-fd66c04e758e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1621498117.223800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VCEn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4294D5E9-9340-4B65-84D5-14FC7E61B517","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vimrcを分けちゃってそれを読むこんでVimを起動するエイリアスコマンド（vimaとかvimbとか）でも用意すると両方楽しめたりもできたりはします。完全ダークパワードなvimrcとか。","ts":"1621495049.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BrzO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"914EA7A0-1DEE-48CD-9D36-6B2B65283068","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"一回無理矢理併用したけど設定を覚えていない","ts":"1621494875.219100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EPT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9A40D441-BA31-404F-99FB-7DDD56192E24","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"自動補完機能が入ってるプラグインの併用はオススメできないですね","ts":"1621494805.217800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uQaY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FF0EDB18-CEFC-42D9-82CA-FAD5830FCEAA","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"（deoplete等の自動補完プラグインと併用したい場合のお話ですね）","ts":"1621494714.216800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kkqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17de7bf1-2b01-408e-85b1-9efed308403c","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`suggest.keepCompleteopt` を `true` だけではだめそうでした。更に追加で `suggest.autoTrigger` を `none` にする必要があるようです。要は coc.nvim で自動補完を完全にしないって設定も追加ですね。","ts":"1621494293.215500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qhc1="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c4d227b-a8c6-4d06-bc12-4a4ef7b639a1","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"`suggest.keepCompleteopt` というオプションはありますがこれをtrueにするのはどうでしょうか？\n\n```\"suggest.keepCompleteopt\":~\n\n\tWhen enabled, 'completeopt' is not overridden. Autocompletion will be\n\tdisabled if 'completeopt' doesn't have 'noinsert' and 'noselect', default:\n\t`false````","ts":"1621491998.214800","edited":{"user":"UJ70JTGR3","ts":"1621492023.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6EFtM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f6f2c5c-d4b5-41a0-8e80-8eb77d5deab0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"自分も同じ状況になって `let b:coc_suggest_disable = 1` 試したけどダメだったから、vim-lspに出戻りした","ts":"1621489753.214200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"neiD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbb807cd-3137-4946-a7c2-b49b1b333d0f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"cocのautocmdが先に実行されているっぽい","ts":"1621469462.204300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pbX1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6580c2f-6920-4891-9cee-aab2458640c4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"む、変わらないな","ts":"1621469391.203900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RTj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d9a73c0-4bd8-475e-9120-b03a85266139","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これでdeopleteをft見て有効にするとかもできるはず","ts":"1621469205.203500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9e6="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e