xt":"どちらも自動補完プラグインなので干渉してますよ","ts":"1621468605.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u+g="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cc3aa56-cc49-4679-bea9-e5c636074682","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これみる限りだと自作自動補完プラグインだな","ts":"1621468595.199500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sxu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a726a4f-e6bc-4373-9422-6b13aeacd422","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"command.vimとcocが干渉している","ts":"1621468499.199400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ey5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c9d5afa-32c5-47df-909b-675cf02779e5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これはオプションのコンフリクトなので","ts":"1621468471.199300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sh1zA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8888f411-cd6c-4eb5-918f-8361b236d4cb","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"[質問]\ncoc.nvimを入れた状態で `completeopt`を変更すると↓メッセージが出るんですが、このメッセージを出さないようにする方法はありますか？\nマニュアルを漁ったんですが、それを制御する方法は見つからなかったです…\n```[coc.nvim]: Some plugin change completeopt on insert mode: Last set from ~/dev/go/src/github.com/skanehira/command.vim/autoload/command/complete.vim line 46!```","ts":"1621467167.199200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gQNS6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa3f9e56-24bb-47df-888a-24a47c55d07b","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"すごい… ありがとうございます","ts":"1621445690.198400","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1621447059.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j+K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59bb30f7-789e-48d3-a278-23f49abaa3a4","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;` がないので `=b:_replacecmdline` は表示されているはずだけど、これだと一瞬になるのでチラついて見えないわけですね","ts":"1621445673.198100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ixTs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57594e2b-af9b-4f18-9562-b04d5e5ce90b","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なるほど… `={expr}` のタイミングで固まらないように先に `Foo()` を評価しておくのか","ts":"1621445618.197300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0O6oL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd1a6d25-3748-4626-8047-5ecdf1d68cd9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ただし環境が十分に遅い場合は見えるかもしれない","ts":"1621444558.196800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"svo3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c8e0ae3-5bb2-4d09-9e3b-e334ac696841","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ちらつかないやつできた\n```function! Foo() abort\n  sleep 100m\n  return \"foo\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"\nendfunction\nfunction! ReplaceCmdLine(s) abort\n  let b:_replacecmdline = a:s\n  return \"\\\u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eb:_replacecmdline\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"\nendfunction\n\ncnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; ReplaceCmdLine(Foo())```","ts":"1621444307.196500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"puro","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JyxLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba08d972-e8e4-43ed-8b65-6ee7a5061480","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ご覧になれたようでよかった（？）","ts":"1621443980.196300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QAs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4978dfb8-7b25-41b6-9e58-2947c03a5285","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"フー","ts":"1621443964.195900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=idZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9131e2d1-04cf-473b-987e-99b327b6c2fd","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"見えた！","ts":"1621443731.195700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oSyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d72d1ca-4d92-43cb-98e6-e52f34873611","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ふー","ts":"1621443702.195400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FkqD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb820f4f-f46a-427f-b82c-e763a8924bd8","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`Foo()` が十分速い場合はそうですね。\n```function Foo()\n  sleep 100m\n  return 'フー'\nendfunction```\nとかにすると多分チラつくと思います","ts":"1621443590.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BX+WV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8758e131-f967-4e38-8647-664c48f7e3c9","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Windows の gvim だと `\u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eFoo()` で一切 `=Foo()` が表示されなかった。\n(もしくは視認できないほど速い？)","ts":"1621443136.194800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zr5z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c935c386-4d39-422d-a9fd-cc85eeb107b3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"すごい","ts":"1621441641.193900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y658"}]},{"client_msg_id":"610c20d9-8c82-4346-ba13-31ef440c9b11","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"とりあえず `\u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;` \u0026amp; `\u0026lt;Space\u0026gt;\u0026lt;BS\u0026gt;` でいけそうなのでこれでやってみます！\nみなさまありがとうございました :panda_dogeza:","ts":"1621439833.193300","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1621443574.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U09QA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb7c1c0-e022-4c83-a662-c88e83a6f6aa","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ほんとだ効かないですね… map の評価中は禁止されてるのかな","ts":"1621439582.193000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kx6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24cbc5a3-243c-47e7-b7da-490eb59d05b9","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"```function! Foo() abort\n  return 'foo'\nendfunction\nfunction! FooRedraw() abort\n    redraw\n    return ''\nendfunction\ncnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo) \u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eFoo()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\ncnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo-redraw) FooRedraw()\ncmap \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo)\u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo-redraw)```","ts":"1621439461.192000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HHu7I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11f5bf7e-8cbb-4fc0-92b8-a69d39063592","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"いま、手元で書いてみたら `:redraw` ダメそうでした…","ts":"1621439411.190900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ptTK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"222a368d-31c8-47ef-96a5-0c1c71fe2b0a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"事情があって、本当は結果を挿入したあとに `CmdlineChanged` を発行させたくないんですが、これはまた別問題なので一旦こちらで考えます。。","ts":"1621439384.190000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NwBK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5db31e4f-e1f8-46e0-b3ad-4d8bf66fc95d","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"たしかに、そのほう見やすそうでいいですね \u0026gt; `\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` マッピング","ts":"1621439329.188700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mq0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"129e3a40-69d5-4627-934d-643aa98116d1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、これはテクい","ts":"1621439236.188400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HAQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8182caf5-ddde-4584-9616-03349bfb779a","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"みたいですね。`redraw` を発行するだけの `\u0026lt;expr\u0026gt;` マッピングとかを別に作るほうがきれいなのかもしれないです","ts":"1621439074.188000","edited":{"user":"U9GUS1S0G","ts":"1621439087.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JN3P7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a05b5bdf-ddc6-4feb-ab93-d9091e550e3a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;BS\u0026gt;` を押すとコマンドラインが redraw される感じなのかな","ts":"1621439012.187100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ww/zV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"915dfc92-531d-43b4-b3ee-a544276f103e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"bashの補完みたいな感じかな \u0026gt; c_CTRL-L","ts":"1621439007.187000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EU8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a052d96d-15bb-4180-867f-c066dad1a02a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"おー、ありがとうございます！ちらつかなくなりました","ts":"1621438991.186500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmwuA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"735d5d18-0806-4236-8363-dd0f8e16fb5f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"再描画ではなさそうな気はしていたけど謎の機能が割り当ててあるのは知らんかった","ts":"1621438988.186300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m1vfs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d24ae86d-39c6-4fe5-8fe6-a999d01920cc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私も知らんかったけど説明を見ても何もわからん","ts":"1621438968.185600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HB05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"661e1078-cdf9-4ab7-97b7-4246ae696db4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"同じくさっき試して上手く動かなくて知った","ts":"1621438951.185100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sc/y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6af5bc4c-8202-461a-8637-a7046a4b234e","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"そういうことか","ts":"1621438940.184400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7w8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39ceeb2c-f30d-496f-a4d2-9665db66ed3b","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"あああ、私 `c_CTRL-L` の存在を知らなかった。画面更新だと思っていた","ts":"1621438934.184200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fol"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcd9776f-b6c6-4183-977e-7c48a28b11d5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ﾁｮｯﾄﾁｶﾞｳ","ts":"1621438882.182400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JFjgE"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *c_CTRL-L*\nCTRL-L          カーソルより前のパターンに対してマッチの検索が行われる。マッチ\n                が1個のときは、それがパターンの位置に挿入される。複数個のマッ\n                チがあったときは、最も長い共通部分がパターンの位置に挿入される。\n                その結果がパターンより短い場合には、補完は行われない。\n```","ts":"1621438873.182000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"8ca6229b-dd04-463a-bedf-05ba4a68ac65","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h c_CTRL-L","ts":"1621438872.181900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"otVu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b33dd20-a8ae-4555-88a5-86ea1c805197","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"`\u0026lt;c-l\u0026gt;` で良いはずなんだけど警告ビープがなるので…","ts":"1621438855.181700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i/gV2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dad5f12a-a483-4416-aa3d-e13c9bbfd3c6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"多分silentの影響の外で画面の書き直しをさせてる？","ts":"1621438842.181400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GnO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1614150f-26c4-4974-a9b0-133d21abde6d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"redraw に必要とかかな","ts":"1621438838.181100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WRGBf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31aa146c-0041-4e1f-b6a8-c0912450e67e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`\u0026lt;Space\u0026gt;\u0026lt;BS\u0026gt;` が必要なのがぜんぜんわからんw","ts":"1621438825.180200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EXv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f55c54e-427c-409c-97c4-9505d26a9a2c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど、一部だけscript local mappingしてしまうと","ts":"1621438808.179700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1d5l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aec3edc9-55d3-4b1a-b01b-853983c651c0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そこ `\u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;` すると消せるのか","ts":"1621438798.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2hZX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca650aee-cf5a-4104-82ca-ed4ed43b4cd4","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"理屈はわからない","ts":"1621438796.179100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BA2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f363a8e1-f7f7-4311-9fcd-f919b6fafc72","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"```function! Foo() abort\n  return 'foo'\nendfunction\ncnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo) \u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eFoo()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\ncmap \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;(Foo)\u0026lt;Space\u0026gt;\u0026lt;BS\u0026gt;```","ts":"1621438767.178400","edited":{"user":"U9GUS1S0G","ts":"1621439196.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qfvdb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99db87d5-38ad-48aa-b724-d93da15defea","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"汚い方法ならあります","ts":"1621438751.178100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H2c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e670bc19-1279-47a5-8b33-1651c6f649f9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いい方法が思い付かない","ts":"1621438742.177800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5kfv2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9633c957-6ae8-455a-9db9-4762f7926eda","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;e` を使った場合は `smile^M` が文字通りに挿入されるようになっていて、こちらの挙動を望んでいます。","ts":"1621438582.177100","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1621440347.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EGfqu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e04b6fa-6817-4943-a134-cedbbd6fac26","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"例えば `Foo()` が `smile^M` (`^M` は改行文字) を返した場合、`smile\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` を打ち込んだのと同じことになるので `smile` が実行されてしまう","ts":"1621438555.176500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Wb"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nCTRL-\\ e {expr}                                         *c_CTRL-\\_e*\n                コマンドラインを {expr} を評価した結果で置き換える。式を入力し\n                \u0026lt;Enter\u0026gt; を押せば完了する。マッピングする時に使うと便利である。\n                |expression| も参照のこと。\n                式の評価を挿入するには |c_CTRL-R_=| を使う。便利な関数に\n                |getcmdtype()| と |getcmdline()| と |getcmdpos()| がある。\n                カーソルが行末になければカーソル位置は変更されない。カーソルが\n                行末にあるときのコマンドライン変更後のカーソル位置は行末であ\n                る。|setcmdpos()| を使うとカーソル位置を変更できる。\n                |sandbox| を使うと不要な副作用を避けて式を評価することができ\n                る。\n                例:  \n                  :cmap \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eAppendSome()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n                  :func AppendSome()\n                    :let cmd = getcmdline() . \" Some()\"\n                    :\" place the cursor on the )\n                    :call setcmdpos(strlen(cmd))\n                    :return cmd\n                  :endfunc\n                これは再帰的には機能しない。つまり、すでに式を編集しているとき\n                は動作しない。ただしマップの中では再帰的に使える。\n```","ts":"1621438537.176100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a8bcb4f4-1918-40aa-834f-5d05f9fb48eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h c_CTRL-\\_e","ts":"1621438536.176000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGTZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fa502d4-969c-4239-be8f-7e9fa3c69fdc","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ありがとうございます\nそれも考えたんですが、微妙に挙動が違ってくるんですよね…","ts":"1621438498.175000","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1621440334.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"byd9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6e15156-47ea-413a-b4dc-99a5e2bae646","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`cnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \"\\\u0026lt;End\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;\" .. Foo()` でどうにかならんかな","ts":"1621438414.174100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ohP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c103bb92-ccc9-4e08-8633-17a510824407","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"やりたいこととしては「コマンドラインをチラつきなしに関数の結果で置き換える」です","ts":"1621438201.173300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a2O3A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a216146c-9032-40cc-a793-b9a39ab15904","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;silen\u0026gt;` を付けると`Foo()` の結果も表示されなくなっちゃうんですよね…","ts":"1621438131.172800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mkh1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04ede9db-82bc-4871-ad1b-9344a461cf13","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(試してないので上手くいくかは不明)","ts":"1621438086.172300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R56/+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f189a9a0-caf6-47d4-8de3-b99f2d0698be","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`\u0026lt;silent\u0026gt;` 付けるとか？","ts":"1621438068.171700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"azi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"600e72d6-9c5c-450e-9d36-6e5119089cce","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"[質問です]\n`c_CTRL-\\_e` を使って\n```cnoremap \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eFoo()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```\nのようなマップを定義すると、`\u0026lt;F7\u0026gt;` を押すことでコマンドラインを `Foo()` の結果で置き換えられるかと思いますが、\nこのとき`=Foo()` が一瞬表示されるのでコマンドラインがチラついたように見えてしまいます。\nこのチラつきを抑制する方法（`=Foo()` を表示しないようにする方法）ってありますか？","ts":"1621438034.171000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KWlGi"}]}]
